# GCC 7.5.0 — MISRA C:2025 Checker Fork

This is a modified version of GCC 7.5.0 with added static analysis support for
MISRA C:2025 rules (Appendix B, Single Translation Unit).

## Added Feature: -Wmisra-c

Enable MISRA C:2025 rule checking by passing `-Wmisra-c` to the compiler:

    gcc -Wmisra-c -std=c11 your_file.c

Violations are reported in the format:

    your_file.c:10:5: warning: MISRA C:2025 Rule X.Y [-Wmisra-c]

## Modified Files

Key source files changed to implement MISRA C:2025 detection:

- `gcc/c/c-parser.c`     — expression parsing, operator precedence rules
- `gcc/c/c-typeck.c`     — type checking, pointer compatibility
- `gcc/c/c-decl.c`       — declarations, struct/VLA checks
- `gcc/c-family/c-lex.c` — lexer, header inclusion checks
- `gcc/tree-cfg.c`        — control flow, missing return checks
- `libcpp/directives.c`   — preprocessor directive checks

## Prerequisites

Before building GCC, install the required development libraries:

    sudo apt update
    sudo apt install libgmp-dev libmpfr-dev libmpc-dev

## Build

    mkdir build && cd build
    ../gcc-7.5.0/configure --prefix=/usr/local/misrac2026 \
        --enable-languages=c --disable-multilib
    make -j$(nproc)
    sudo make install

> `$(nproc)` automatically uses all available CPU cores.
> You can also specify manually, e.g. `make -j8` for an 8-core machine.

---

# GCC 7.5.0 — MISRA C:2025 檢查器分支

本專案是 GCC 7.5.0 的修改版，新增了對 MISRA C:2025 規則的靜態分析支援，
涵蓋附錄 B（Single Translation Unit）中的規則。

## 新增功能：-Wmisra-c

編譯時加上 `-Wmisra-c` 即可啟用 MISRA C:2025 規則檢查：

    gcc -Wmisra-c -std=c11 your_file.c

違規回報格式如下：

    your_file.c:10:5: warning: MISRA C:2025 Rule X.Y [-Wmisra-c]

## 修改的檔案

實作 MISRA C:2025 偵測所修改的主要原始檔：

- `gcc/c/c-parser.c`     — 運算式解析、運算子優先順序規則
- `gcc/c/c-typeck.c`     — 型別檢查、指標相容性
- `gcc/c/c-decl.c`       — 宣告、struct／VLA 檢查
- `gcc/c-family/c-lex.c` — 詞法分析器、標頭檔引入檢查
- `gcc/tree-cfg.c`        — 控制流程、缺少 return 檢查
- `libcpp/directives.c`   — 前處理器指令檢查

## 先備條件

在編譯 GCC 之前，需要先安裝 GMP、MPFR 與 MPC 的開發套件：

    sudo apt update
    sudo apt install libgmp-dev libmpfr-dev libmpc-dev

## 建構方式

    mkdir build && cd build
    ../gcc-7.5.0/configure --prefix=/usr/local/misrac2026 \
        --enable-languages=c --disable-multilib
    make -j$(nproc)
    sudo make install

> `$(nproc)` 會自動使用所有可用的 CPU 核心數。
> 也可以手動指定，例如八核心機器用 `make -j8`。

